DreamTextStyle {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUITextData.h#DreamTextStyle
    src   "How the built-in shader draws a text's glyphs beyond the plain face: outline, underlay (drop\nshadow), glow, and how the unfilled part of a lyric line looks. Lengths are in em, so a style\nreads the same at every font size. Only distance-field fonts (MTSDF) render these; bitmap fonts\ndraw the face alone.\n\nThe style is stored per widget in the canvas's widget property texture, so texts with different\nstyles still batch into one draw."
    text  "内置着色器如何绘制文本字形在本体之外的部分：描边、底层（投影）、发光，以及歌词行未填充部分的\n样式。长度以em为单位，因此同一样式\n在各字号下表现一致。只有距离场字体（MTSDF）会渲染这些效果；位图字体\n仅绘制本体。\n\n样式按控件存储在画布的控件属性纹理中，因此使用不同样式的文本\n仍可合批为一次绘制。"
    state machine
}

DreamTextStyle:FaceDilate {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUITextData.h#DreamTextStyle:FaceDilate
    src   "Grow (positive) or shrink (negative) the face, in em."
    text  "以em为单位放大（正值）或缩小（负值）本体。"
    state machine
}

DreamTextStyle:FacePaint {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUITextData.h#DreamTextStyle:FacePaint
    src   "Fill the face with a gradient instead of the text's colour, as CSS's `background-clip: text` with `color: transparent`\ndoes: the face is the gradient times the content tint, a custom style's Multiply and TextAnimation's colour, and the\ntext's own Color is not used for it. A <color> run inside stays solid, and so does a hovered link. Emoji keep their\ncolours. Works on every kind of glyph -- distance field, small-text coverage, bitmap -- and on underlines and\nstrikethroughs; drawn by the built-in shader and by materials built on MF_DreamUI_Shade, approximated in the vertex\ncolours for any other material."
    text  "用渐变而非文本颜色填充字面，效果如同 CSS 的 `background-clip: text` 配合 `color: transparent`\n所做的那样：字面等于渐变乘以内容着色、自定义样式的 Multiply 与 TextAnimation 的颜色，文本自身的 Color\n不参与其中。内部的 <color>…</color> 区段保持纯色，悬停的链接也是如此。表情符号保留其\n颜色。适用于所有类型的字形——距离场、小字号覆盖、位图——以及下划线与\n删除线；由内置着色器以及基于 MF_DreamUI_Shade 的材质绘制，其他材质则在顶点\n颜色中近似。"
    state machine
}

DreamTextStyle:FaceSoftness {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUITextData.h#DreamTextStyle:FaceSoftness
    src   "Extra edge softness (blur) in em. 0 draws a crisp edge. Each glyph softens on its own, so past\nabout 0.05 em the halos of neighbouring glyphs visibly merge; a real blur of a whole line is a\npost-process job, not a style."
    text  "以em为单位的额外边缘柔化（模糊）。0表示绘制清晰的边缘。每个字形各自柔化，因此超过\n约0.05 em后，相邻字形的光晕会明显融合；整行的真正模糊属于\n后处理工作，而不是样式。"
    state machine
}

