EDreamTextPhraseWrap {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUITextData.h#EDreamTextPhraseWrap
    src   "Whether CJK text wraps between words rather than between any two characters.\n\nThe line-break rules (UAX #14) let a line end between any two ideographs, which is what every\nbrowser does by default. CSS Text 4 added `word-break: auto-phrase` to keep words together instead;\nthis is the same idea, using the dictionary ICU ships for Chinese and Japanese. A word that does not\nfit on a line still breaks inside under AllowPerCharacterWrapping, so it never makes text overflow."
    text  "CJK 文本是否在词之间换行，而不是在任意两个字符之间换行。\n\n换行规则（UAX #14）允许在任意两个表意文字之间断行，这是每个\n浏览器的默认行为。CSS Text 4 增加了 `word-break: auto-phrase`，改为保持词完整；\n这里思路相同，使用的是 ICU 随附的中文和日文词典。放不下一行的词在\nAllowPerCharacterWrapping 下仍会在词内断开，因此文本永远不会溢出。"
    state machine
}

