    src   "`<gradient=Name>...</gradient>`: what is inside is painted with the gradient Name resolves to -- the custom style\nentry of that name, a project preset (UDreamGUISettings::GradientPresets), or Name read as CSS written without\nspaces -- measured across the run. Nested like <color>, and against it: the innermost of the two wins. Appended."
    text  "`<gradient=Name>...</gradient>`：其中的内容用 Name 解析出的渐变绘制——即该名称的自定义样式\n条目、项目预设（UDreamGUISettings::GradientPresets），或将 Name 按去掉空格的 CSS 解读——\n沿整个区段度量。像 <color>…</color> 一样嵌套，且与之相对：两者中更内层的生效。追加。"
