    src   "Replace the middle of each line that does not fit with \"...\", keeping its start and its end -- Slate's\nETextOverflowPolicy::MiddleEllipsis. Each hard line on its own; with wrapping, an end ellipsis on the last visible\nline instead. Measured against the box, like Truncate and Ellipsis."
    text  "如果超出范围，则用“...”替换每行的中间部分，同时保留其开头和结尾 -- Slate 的 ETextOverflowPolicy::MiddleEllipsis。每行独立处理；如果换行，则在最后一行的末尾显示省略号。相对于显示区域进行测量。\n\n当文本超出显示区域时，在垂直方向上使用省略号进行截断。"
    state machine
}

