EDreamUITextParagraphHorizontalAlign.Justify {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUITextData.h#EDreamUITextParagraphHorizontalAlign:Justify
    src   "Both edges: a line that wrapped gets the room it lacks spread over its justification opportunities (TextJustify);\nthe paragraph's last line, and a line a newline ends, align as LastLineAlign says. Never shrinks, never stretches\nArabic (no kashida). Appended, so saved alignments keep their meaning."
    text  "如果超出范围，则换行符后面的文本会被截断。\n\n对齐文本。"
    state machine
}

EDreamUITextTransformPolicy {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUITextData.h#EDreamUITextTransformPolicy
    src   "Case applied to the text on its way into the layout, UMG's ETextTransformPolicy. The Text property\nitself is untouched -- this is presentation, so a caret index and a copy still see what was authored."
    text  "文本进入布局时所应用的大小写转换，即UMG的ETextTransformPolicy。Text属性\n本身不受影响——这只是呈现，因此插入符索引和复制操作看到的仍是创作时的内容。"
    state machine
}

